		<item>
			<title>Gossip: Reportedly Lourdes judged the London's dance auditions and will be one of the dancers on Madonna's Next Tour</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/122-reportedly-lourdes-judged-the-londons-dance-auditions-for-madonnas-next-tour.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/122-reportedly-lourdes-judged-the-londons-dance-auditions-for-madonnas-next-tour.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>We at DrownedMadonna.com were the first to break the news of <strong>dance auditions</strong> in <strong>London's Pineapple Dance Studios</strong> for <strong>Madonna's next tour</strong>, as part of <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project</strong>.</p>
<p>Besides uploading their one-minute video online, applicants had the chance to audition in New York and <strong>London</strong>. New York's dance audition took place with choreographers Tony and Rich Talauega as judges on September 8, while London casting call took place last Friday and no judges were announced.</p>
<p>But according to a gossip published on today's <strong>Daily Star</strong>, hordes of dancers in <strong>London</strong> were surprised to find out that <strong>Madonna</strong>'s daugher, <strong>Lourdes</strong>, was there to judge them. According to the British tabloid, Lola has been a pupil at the <strong>Pineapple Studios</strong> for years and she has perfected a mix of styles now.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Reportedly, <strong>Lourdes</strong> will join the team of <strong>dancers</strong> on <strong>Madonna's next tour</strong> and promo-tour. "<strong>Lourdes</strong> does routines every day in her mum’s studios as well as taking classes," a source told <strong>the Star</strong>. "She can now do jazz, hip-hop, popping, contemporary and even tap. That's why she is qualified to judge who would be the best back-up dancers for her mum."</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> is confirmed by Live Nation for the final dance competition on November 12 in New York City, when one dancer will be chosen for her next tour, in collaboration with <strong>Smirnoff</strong> as part of a multi-deal.</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Smirnoff</li><li>Dancers Auditions</li><li>London</li><li>Lourdes</li><ul></div>]]></description>
			<category>Tours</category>
